						Like, one of the places that have an artifact?\p
						We need to find it!\p
						But, a Guardian might be there too.\p
						Brr…\n
						Let's try and steer clear from Team MAGA and from any Guardians, ok?"))
						closemessage
						applymovement(LOCALID_VEE, Common_Movement_PartyMemberReturnsToPlayerEast)
						waitmovement(LOCALID_VEE)
						removeobject(LOCALID_VEE)
						setvar(VAR_VOLTBROOK_TOWN_STATE, 1)
					}
                releaseall
                end
		}
